{"id":"wb-3-145","name":"广教寺双塔","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"广教寺双塔","text":"广教寺双塔位于中国安徽省宣城市宣州区城北的敬亭山东南麓，1988年被列为第三批全国重点文物保护单位。\n广教寺已毁，双塔建于北宋绍圣三年（1096年），为仿木结构楼阁式砖塔，均为七层，高17米，两塔相距26.9米。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%B9%BF%E6%95%99%E5%AF%BA%E5%8F%8C%E5%A1%94","revisionId":85379492,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=85379492","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/7fefadb2d02bc4b00e65d65a.jpg","title":"Twin_Pagodas_of_Guangjiao_Temple_03_2021-03.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Twin_Pagodas_of_Guangjiao_Temple_03_2021-03.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/ea/Twin_Pagodas_of_Guangjiao_Temple_03_2021-03.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"猫猫的日记本","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​宣城广教寺双塔之西塔，东南面。","width":320,"height":213}}